            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\n  \"schema\": \"wardogs-terrain-ballistics-v1\",\n  \"status\": \"SAFE_RELEASE_CANDIDATE_2026-08-24__PLUS_EXPERIMENTAL_OPT_IN_TERRAIN_CORRECTION_2026-08-30\",\n  \"mapId\": \"bakurani\",\n  \"weaponId\": \"spg\",\n  \"ammo\": \"155MM HE SHELL\",\n  \"arc\": \"full-range\",\n  \"terrainManifest\": \"data/terrain/bakurani/manifest.json\",\n  \"terrainMaps\": {\n    \"bakurani\": {\n      \"terrainManifest\": \"data/terrain/bakurani/manifest.json\"\n    },\n    \"ozeti\": {\n      \"terrainManifest\": \"data/terrain/ozeti/manifest.json\"\n    },\n    \"zestafona\": {\n      \"terrainManifest\": \"data/terrain/zestafona/manifest.json\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"releasePolicy\": {\n    \"automaticMilCorrection\": true,\n    \"flatTableAuthoritative\": true,\n    \"suppressionMissMeters\": 10,\n    \"heightCorrection\": \"data/ballistics/height-correction.json\",\n    \"correctedMaps\": [\n      \"bakurani\"\n    ],\n    \"reason\": \"Height correction is on for every arc on the maps in correctedMaps. spg.low was enabled on 2026-08-27: a sweep of 1652 (arc, range, deltaZ) cells found no case where correcting is worse than ignoring, and on the low arc it is the difference between roughly 600 m of miss and 25 m against a model perturbed 2% in muzzle velocity. Still off for maps outside correctedMaps: Bakurani's coordinate alignment was validated by visual overlay after the Y-flip fix in 5c462a173, Ozeti's never was. The projectile model remains a vacuum fit to our own tables and has never been checked against the game; see docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-26-elevation-correction-design.md section 8.\"\n  },\n  \"experimentalCorrection\": {\n    \"available\": true,\n    \"defaultEnabled\": false,\n    \"storageKey\": \"wardogs-experimental-terrain-correction\",\n    \"weaponId\": \"spg\",\n    \"ammo\": \"155MM HE SHELL\",\n    \"safeStatus\": \"SAFE_CONSENSUS\",\n    \"platformCorrection\": false,\n    \"payloads\": {\n      \"lowMain\": {\n        \"url\": \